        <ul>
          <li>Convert JPG and JPEG images to PNG, WebP, and PDF formats</li>
          <li>Convert PNG images to JPG format</li>
          <li>Convert WebP images to JPG format</li>
          <li>Resize JPG images</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          All image processing is performed entirely within the user's web browser.
          No files are uploaded to our servers.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Eligibility</h2>
        <p>
          Our services are available to anyone with a modern web browser and an
          internet connection. By using our services, you represent that you are at
          least 13 years of age (or the minimum age required in your jurisdiction).
          If you are under 18, you represent that you have parental consent to use
          our services.
        </p>

        <h2>4. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>You agree to use our services only for lawful purposes. You must not:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use our services to process images that contain illegal, harmful, or offensive content</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or abuse our website or its infrastructure</li>
          <li>Use automated scripts, bots, or scrapers to access our services</li>
          <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract the source code of our tools</li>
          <li>Use our services in any way that violates applicable laws or regulations</li>
          <li>Interfere with or circumvent any security or access controls</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>

