          extract the source code of our tools, except as expressly permitted by
          applicable law.
        </p>

        <h3>5.2 User Content</h3>
        <p>
          You retain full ownership of any images you process using our tools. We
          claim no ownership, rights, or interest in any content you upload or
          convert. Since all processing happens client-side, you maintain complete
          control over your files at all times.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Your privacy is important to us. Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          explains how we handle data when you use our services. By using our
          services, you consent to the data practices described in the Privacy
